      "releaseNotes": "Welcome to Microsoft Edge! Here's what's new in this release:\n• Introducing the News Widget: a faster way to stay up to date with the latest news, right from your home screen.\n• Meet the refreshed Copilot in Edge! Find answers, organize your thoughts, and spark new ideas, all in your browser.\nUpgrade now to enjoy a smarter, faster, and more productive Microsoft Edge.",
